        <p>The main factors that push a price up are the number of pages, custom functionality — booking forms, calculators, membership areas, online payments — the quality of design work, content writing, and ongoing hosting and maintenance. A basic informational site with a contact form sits at the low end. A site with a booking engine, custom integrations or an admin dashboard sits well above it.</p>
