        <p>DIY platforms such as Squarespace, Wix or Shopify start much lower — subscription plans run from around $20 to $80 per month in Australia — but they come with real trade-offs. You or someone on your team designs and maintains the site, you are locked into that platform's template system, and adding anything outside the built-in tools usually means a third-party plugin or a developer anyway. They work well for the simplest sites; they become limiting quickly as your requirements grow.</p>
