        <p>The process is mostly asynchronous. Brisbane is two hours ahead of Manila, and Sydney and Melbourne are two to three hours ahead depending on daylight saving, meaning most of the Australian business day overlaps with our hours. We schedule a video call for the brief, send a staging link for your review and respond to feedback within 24 hours on our side.</p>
        <p>Our guide to <a href="https://www.fazeddigital.com/blog/offshore-web-design-australia">working with a Philippine web studio from Australia</a> covers what to check before engaging anyone, how payment and revisions work, and what happens if changes are needed after launch.</p>
