        <p>Good <a href="https://www.fazeddigital.com/blog/mobile-first-web-design">mobile-first web design</a> for a contractor site means compressing project photos without losing quality, making phone numbers tap-to-call, and ensuring your contact form works cleanly on a small screen. These are not design extras — they are the baseline for any trade business site.</p>
